 {"id":"app-development","name":"Mobile apps","short":"iOS and Android apps built around what your customers need to do.","symbol":"▯","eyebrow":"MOBILE PRODUCTS","intro":"The best app experiences feel considered at every tap. We bring product thinking, clear interaction design, and careful engineering together from the first sketch.","why":"Make the useful thing feel effortless.","details":[("Product discovery","Identify the essential job your app needs to do.","Customer interviews|Product definition|Feature prioritisation|Prototyping"),("App experience","Make each screen clear, accessible, and a pleasure to use.","User flows|Interface design|Interactive prototypes|Design systems"),("Engineering & delivery","Build a dependable product that’s ready for the real world.","iOS & Android planning|App development|API integration|Release readiness"),("Learn & evolve","Use real product signal to plan the next version.","Usage analytics|Feedback loops|Roadmapping|Ongoing improvements")],"faq":[("Do you build for iOS and Android?","We help choose a native or cross-platform approach based on your product, resources, and roadmap."),("Can you help with an existing app?","Yes. We can audit the current experience, prioritise improvements, and partner on a redesign or development sprint."),("Do you handle app store submission?","We can help prepare release assets and submission requirements as part of the agreed launch scope.")]},
